  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 121,
      "end": 180,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第一步，n=3 时取循环排列 (1,2,4)。三个数互异，任意两数均相邻；1|2、2|4、1|4，因此 n=3 快乐。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 181,
      "end": 285,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第二步，n=4 时取循环排列 (2,12,3,18)。每一对相邻元素有整除关系：2|12、3|12、3|18、2|18；而仅有两对不相邻的数 (2,3) 与 (12,18)，两对均互不整除，故 n=4 快乐。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 286,
      "end": 372,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第三步，对任一偶数 n=2k≥6，取 k 个彼此不同的素数 p₁,…,p_k，令 p_{k+1}=p₁，并循环排列 p₁,p₁p₂,p₂,p₂p₃,…,p_k,p_kp₁。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 372,
      "end": 439,
      "sourceExcerpt": "所有单素数互异；每个乘积包含恰好两个不同素因子，且 k≥3 时相邻素数的无序二元集合两两不同，故这些乘积也互异，且不会等于任何单素数。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 439,
      "end": 472,
      "sourceExcerpt": "每对相邻数为 p_i 和含 p_i 因子的相邻乘积，必有整除关系。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 472,
      "end": 572,
      "sourceExcerpt": "对不相邻的两数：两个单素数互不整除；两个不同乘积都是两个互异素数之积，若其中一个整除另一个则二者相同，矛盾；单素数 p_i 仅能整除含 p_i 的两个相邻乘积，不能整除其他乘积，复合数也不整除单素数。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 572,
      "end": 598,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因此构造满足要求。这证明 6、8、10、12 快乐。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "index": 7,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 599,
      "end": 618,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第四步，证明 n>3 为奇数时不快乐。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_7",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-8",
      "index": 8,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 618,
      "end": 647,
      "sourceExcerpt": "反设存在符合条件的循环排列 a₁,…,a_n，下标模 n。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_8",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-9",
      "index": 9,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 647,
      "end": 673,
      "sourceExcerpt": "相邻数互异且一个整除另一个，因此必有严格的大小方向。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_9",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-10",
      "index": 10,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 673,
      "end": 763,
      "sourceExcerpt": "若存在三个连续元素 a_i<a_{i+1}<a_{i+2}，因相邻整除，得 a_i|a_{i+1}|a_{i+2}，从而 a_i|a_{i+2}；当 n>3 时这两数不相邻，矛盾。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_10",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-11",
      "index": 11,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 763,
      "end": 777,
      "sourceExcerpt": "三个连续元素严格递减时同理。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_11",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-12",
      "index": 12,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 777,
      "end": 801,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因此绕圆每两个相邻的大小方向只能交替，一升一降。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_12",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-13",
      "index": 13,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 801,
      "end": 828,
      "sourceExcerpt": "奇数条边的环无法做到严格交替，故奇数 n>3 不快乐。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_13",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-14",
      "index": 14,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 829,
      "end": 855,
      "sourceExcerpt": "综合可得所求 n 恰为 3、4、6、8、10、12。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_14",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
